flowchart TD
    O[Order intent detected] --> Ask1[Ask: Client Name]
    Ask1 --> Ask2[Ask: Product / Service Name]
    Ask2 --> Ask3[Ask: Quantity]
    Ask3 --> Ask4[Ask: Delivery Address]
    Ask4 --> Confirm[Read back details for confirmation]
    Confirm --> ConfirmOK{Customer confirms?}
    ConfirmOK -- No, corrects --> Ask1
    ConfirmOK -- Yes --> Ask5{Payment Mode?}

    Ask5 -- Cash on Delivery --> COD[Create order: status = confirmed_cod]
    Ask5 -- Online --> Online[Create order: status = pending_payment]

    Online --> GenLink[Generate payment link via gateway]
    GenLink --> SendWA[Send link to client's WhatsApp]
    SendWA --> EndCall[Agent ends call — does not wait on line]
    EndCall --> Wait{Payment webhook result}
    Wait -- Failed / Timeout --> Reminder[Send WhatsApp reminder or mark order failed]
    Wait -- Success --> GenTrack[Generate Tracking ID]

    COD --> GenTrack
    GenTrack --> GenInvoice[Generate structured invoice]
    GenInvoice --> SendConfirm[Send tracking ID + order link via WhatsApp]
    SendConfirm --> LogConv[Log full conversation: number, name, subject, transcript]
    Reminder --> LogConv
    LogConv --> End([End])